  "darklings_family_column": {
    "question": "Where SHOULD the Darklings/Dark Aperture family column be?",
    "older_sv_ground_truth": "COLUMN 4 (x=428): the drxlaytrap 'irregular demon/Darklings' summon at tier3 (428,279) + its modifier drxlaytrap_rapidconstruction at tier5 (428,155), tier4 EMPTY between, clean straight 3-tile bar. This is the authoritative home in BOTH SV 0.41 and SV 0.9.",
